12:["$","section",null,{"className":"product-section pocket-section","id":"pocket","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"pocket-copy","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"ポケット"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"test-label","children":"内部テスト中"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"席を離れても、必要な返事を"}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>ポケットは、mycmux で動くエージェントの様子を iPhone から見て、返事を返すためのアプリです。今は内部テスト中で、配布はこれからです。</p><p>返事を待つ作業を見つけ、そのまま会話を読んで答えられます。</p><p><a href=\"/pocket\">ポケットについて</a></p>"}}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"pocket-figure","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-frame","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-top","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"ポケット"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"mycmux"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-body","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-heading","children":"作業の状況"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-subtitle","children":"返事を待っています"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-conversation","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"product-chip waiting","children":"要回答"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"レポートの確認"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Claude Code"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"見出しを短くしてもよいですか？"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-choice","children":"短くしてください"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-choice secondary","children":"今のままにする"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-row","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"product-chip working","children":"作業中"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"実装の見直し"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Codex"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-row","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"product-chip done","children":"完了"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"資料の整理"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Claude Code"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"phone-home"}]]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"一覧から会話を開き、返事を返す画面の再現です。"}]]}]]}]
13:["$","section",null,{"className":"product-section compare-section","id":"compare","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"できることを比べる"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"ターミナルを並べるだけの場合との違い"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"comparison","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>mycmux は、ターミナルを並べる作業に、会話を引き継いで見守るための道具を足します。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>したいこと</th><th>ターミナルを並べるだけの場合</th><th>mycmux</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>複数の作業を見る</td><td>端末を並べて確認</td><td>タブを分けて並べ、拡大もできる</td></tr>\n<tr><td>続きを任せる</td><td>引き継ぐ内容と起動を自分で用意</td><td>引き継ぎ書を添えて、見えるペインで相手を起動</td></tr>\n<tr><td>返事待ちを探す</td><td>各端末の出力を確認</td><td>「要回答」の会話を一覧で確認</td></tr>\n<tr><td>区切りから再開する</td><td>要点と再開方法を自分で記録</td><td>セーブポイントにまとめて保存</td></tr>\n<tr><td>文書を確かめる</td><td>文書を開く道具を別に用意</td><td>会話の隣でプレビュー</td></tr></tbody></table><p>比較は、ターミナルを並べる操作だけを対象にしています。拡張機能や別の道具を組み合わせた場合は含みません。</p>"}}]]}]
14:["$","section",null,{"className":"product-section faq-section","id":"faq","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"よくある質問"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"はじめる前に"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-list","children":[["$","details","どの OS で使えますか？",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["どの OS で使えますか？",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Windows と macOS（Apple Silicon）で使えます。macOS の配布物は universal 形式ですが、Intel Mac での実機動作は未確認です。</p>"}}]]}],["$","details","エージェントも一緒に入りますか？",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["エージェントも一緒に入りますか？",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Claude Code や Codex などは別に入れます。普段の端末で起動できる状態にしてから、mycmux で開いてください。</p>"}}]]}],["$","details","別のエージェントへ任せるには何が要りますか？",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["別のエージェントへ任せるには何が要りますか？",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Python 3 と委譲 CLI が必要です。委譲 CLI は公開リポジトリか「設定 → AI → Claude Code スキル」から導入できます。</p>"}}]]}],["$","details","スマホからも使えますか？",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["スマホからも使えますか？",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>iPhone 用のポケットは内部テスト中です。ブラウザで開く入口にも、PC 側のサーバと Tailscale の配信準備が必要です。</p>"}}]]}],["$","details","どんな文書を開けますか？",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["どんな文書を開けますか？",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Markdown、HTML、Word、Excel、PowerPoint、PDF とテキストを開けます。</p>"}}]]}],["$","details","ライセンスは何ですか？",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["ライセンスは何ですか？",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>GPL-3.0 です。<a aria-label=\"ソースとライセンス\" href=\"https://github.com/miyafcos/mycmux-team\">ソースとライセンス</a>を公開しています。</p>"}}]]}]]}]]}]
